  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Welding apprenticeships to empower youth in Uganda</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Little by Little, small donations put together can help disadvantaged youth in Uganda to acquire artisanal livelihood skills, so that they may be able to earn incomes &amp; be able to feed hundreds of desperate households. 78% of Ugandans are aged 30 years &amp; below, of whom 48% are a dependent population, aged 14 years &amp; below. Thus, youth aged 15-30 years, 30% of Uganda&apos;s population, are mostly bearing the  burden to provide for its 40 million people; &amp; yet, youth in Uganda are largely unemployed.</narrative>
  </description>
